course: dictionary
lesson: 15593
title: Taco: a word from the table
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A taco is a Mexican food. It is a folded tortilla, which is a thin flat bread made of corn or wheat, filled with meat, beans, cheese or salad. Read the words around it to work out what it means: «We had tacos for tea on Friday.» People eat tacos for tea, so tacos must be a food.
explain: The words around a word can also tell you what kind of word it is. «Each person eats 3 tacos.» You can count tacos, so tacos is a noun for things you can count, and more than one taco ends in s.
explain: Context clues can also help with phrases. «Fish tacos» are tacos filled with fish. «Taco night» is a family meal when everyone eats tacos. Many families eat tacos at home, at school lunches and in restaurants, and in the USA, Canada and Australia some people even have a «Taco Tuesday».
fact: A taco is a Mexican food.
fact: A taco is made from a folded tortilla, a thin flat bread made of corn or wheat.
fact: A taco can be filled with meat, beans, cheese or salad.
fact: «Fish tacos» are tacos filled with fish.
fact: The plural of taco is tacos, which means more than one taco.
exercise: «Maya ate two tacos for lunch.» What is a taco? | A kind of school bag | *A folded tortilla filled with food, from Mexico | A Mexican food made of a folded tortilla filled with meat, beans or cheese | A type of football boot
exercise: «Each person eats 3 tacos.» If 2 people each eat 3 tacos, how many tacos do they eat altogether? | 3 | 9 | *6 | 5
exercise: Which word means more than one taco? | tacoed | *tacos | taco | a taco
test: «Fish tacos are my favourite on taco night.» What does fish tacos mean? | *Tacos filled with fish, from a shop that sells fish | Tacos filled with fish | Fish that swim in a taco shell | A fish wearing a hat
test: Lily asks, «What is a taco shell?» What is the answer? | A plate for soup | Something to paint walls with | A type of dessert with cream | *A folded tortilla before it is filled
exam: Ben reads, «The tacos were filled with beans, cheese and salad.» What is a taco? | A kind of bus | A bag for school books | *A Mexican food, a folded tortilla filled with food | A type of wet weather
